        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    add_on_rate = 6.50\n    days_to_maturity = 150\n    days_in_year = 360\n    bond_year = 365\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    holding_period_return = (add_on_rate / 100) * (days_to_maturity / days_in_year)\n    bond_equivalent_yield = holding_period_return * (bond_year / days_to_maturity) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(bond_equivalent_yield, 2)\n```",
